      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town grew around a lumber industry, with a sawmill built by the Starke Bros. in 1880.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townshipofarcadia.org/arcadia-historical-museum.html",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Arcadia’s railroad history includes the Arcadia & Betsey River Railway, which linked the town to the Pere Marquette Railroad via Henry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
