      "source": "https://www.townshipofarcadia.org/arcadia-historical-museum.html",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Arcadia Lake connects to Arcadia Marsh, one of Michigan’s only natural marshes, and Bowens Creek runs through it.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
